# Caveman Commit Rules
STRICT: All commit messages must follow the `caveman-commit` skill rules.

- Format: `<type>(<scope>): <subject>`
- Style: ULTRA-TERSE. No articles. No filler.
- Focus: WHY over WHAT.
- Length: Max 40 chars.
- Imperative mood.
- No trailing period.
- No capitalization after colon.

Example: `feat(home): sticky header + centered fab`
